<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>아이(AI)티콘 클래스</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #6c5ce7;
            --secondary-color: #a29bfe;
            --bg-color: #f9f9fb;
            --text-color: #2d3436;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, system-ui, Roboto, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .container {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 500px;
            background: white;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .emoji-header {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }

        p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #636e72;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .menu-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .menu-item {
            display: block;
            padding: 1.2rem;
            background-color: white;
            border: 2px solid var(--secondary-color);
            border-radius: 15px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .menu-item:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: white;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.3);
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 3rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #b2bec3;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="emoji-header">🎨</div>
        <h1>반가워요! 지금 기분이 어때요?</h1>
        <p>나만의 생성형 AI 친구, 아이(AI)티콘!<br>어떤 그림 스타일로 그릴까요?</p>

        <div class="menu-group">
            <a href="#" class="menu-item">👤 내 캐릭터 만들기</a>
            <a href="#" class="menu-item">😊 표정 스티커 만들기</a>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            © 2026 AI-ticon Class. All rights reserved.
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
